      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i've heard the \"it gets better\" stuff before. but it doesn't feel like grief. it feels like a finished chapter. like i've been emptied out and there's nothing left to refill. it's just exhausting to keep pretending there's a person in here when all i feel is this massive, heavy nothingness. it's like a quiet weight that never goes away.",
